<title>FINLAND: Finnish Jan export prices fall 5.4 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Finnish Jan export prices fall 5.4 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish markka-denominated export prices fell 0.1 percent in January on December and they fell 5.4 percent year-on-year, Statistics Finland (SF) said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>			Jan 1997	  Dec 1996	Jan 1996</p>
<p> Mth/mth	    -0.1 pct	  -0.9 pct	+0.2 pct</p>
<p> Yr/yr		-5.4 pct	  -5.1 pct	+8.1 pct</p>
<p>(Import prices:)</p>
<p>			 Jan 1996	 Dec 1996	Jan 1996</p>
<p> Mth/mth	     +0.7 pct	 +/-0 pct	+0.8 pct</p>
<p> Yr/yr		 +2.1 pct	 +2.2 pct	+0.5 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358 - 9 - 680 50 245</p>
</text>
